Try:

q<-ggplot(test, aes(x=coord, y=value, fill=factor(exp))) +

geom_bar(aes(fill=exp), color="black",stat="identity",position =

"dodge", colour="black")+theme(axis.text.x = element_text(angle = 90,
hjust = 1, vjust = 0.5))+scale_y_continuous(trans = "log10")

Outside of the aesthetic you can set things manually, usually.

HTH
Brian

